  "term": "Prozac",
  "definition": "Prozac refers to fluoxetine hydrochloride, a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor. It is a medication with antidepressant, anti-anxiety, anti-obsessional, and antibulimic effects that works by reducing serotonin reuptake and increasing serotonin activity in the synaptic space.",
